{% comment %}
  Cellexia Reviews — main product reviews app block (Amazon-fidelity widget).

  SSR paints instantly from the `cellexia` product metafields (rating, rating_count,
  distribution, summary, top_reviews) so the header, AI summary and top reviews are
  indexable with zero JS. assets/cellexia-reviews.js then hydrates live data from the
  app proxy JSON API (/apps/cellexia-reviews/api) and fills the containers.

  Container contract with the JS (section() lookup): every hydratable container
  carries a value-style hook — data-cx="header|summary|media-strip|controls|
  active-filters|list|pagination|write" — matching demo/index.html.

  v1.2 live/preview gating (SPEC-1.2): the app syncs the merchant's go-live state
  into the boolean SHOP metafield `cellexia.live`. An absent metafield counts as
  live (upgrade-neutral for pre-1.2 installs). The theme editor (request.design_mode)
  always renders the full widget so merchants can place/configure the block. When
  the store is NOT live on the real storefront, only a minimal hidden shell is
  rendered — the root div with all its data attributes plus data-cx-live="false"
  and `hidden`, the cx-i18n dictionary, and the CSS/JS assets. No SSR content and
  no JSON-LD. The JS un-hides the shell only for tokenized admin previews
  (?cx_preview=…) and builds the missing containers itself.
{% endcomment %}
{%- if product -%}
{{ 'cellexia-reviews.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- liquid
  comment
    v1.2 (SPEC-1.2): app-synced `cellexia.live` SHOP metafield. Only an explicit
    false means "not live" — absent/invalid values stay live so upgraded stores
    never go dark. The theme editor always shows the full widget.
  endcomment
  assign cx_is_live = true
  if shop.metafields.cellexia.live.value == false
    assign cx_is_live = false
  endif
  assign cx_show_full = cx_is_live
  if request.design_mode
    assign cx_show_full = true
  endif

  assign cx_lang = request.locale.iso_code | split: '-' | first

  assign cx_default_locale = 'en'
  for cx_loc in shop.published_locales
    if cx_loc.primary
      assign cx_default_locale = cx_loc.iso_code
    endif
  endfor

  assign cx_heading = block.settings.heading
  if cx_heading == blank
    assign cx_heading = 'cellexia.widget.title' | t
  endif

  assign cx_ns = product.metafields.cellexia

  assign cx_has_stats = false
  assign cx_rating = 0
  assign cx_count = 0
  if cx_ns.rating and cx_ns.rating_count
    assign cx_rating = cx_ns.rating.value | times: 1.0
    assign cx_count = cx_ns.rating_count.value | times: 1
    if cx_count > 0
      assign cx_has_stats = true
    endif
  endif

  assign cx_dist = nil
  if cx_ns.distribution
    assign cx_dist = cx_ns.distribution.value
  endif

  assign cx_summary = nil
  if cx_ns.summary
    assign cx_summary = cx_ns.summary.value
  endif
  assign cx_has_summary = false
  if cx_summary and cx_summary.text
    assign cx_has_summary = true
  endif
  assign cx_topics_size = 0
  if cx_summary
    if cx_summary.topics
      assign cx_topics_size = cx_summary.topics.size
    endif
  endif

  assign cx_top = nil
  assign cx_top_size = 0
  if cx_ns.top_reviews
    assign cx_top = cx_ns.top_reviews.value
    if cx_top
      assign cx_top_size = cx_top.size
    endif
  endif

  assign cx_rating_str = cx_rating | round: 1 | append: ''
  assign cx_count_str = cx_count | append: ''

  comment
    Settings the block cannot read from the app DB. The app may sync them into
    `cellexia` shop metafields; until then: no data-brand attribute (the JS falls
    back to the Setting default "Cellexia") and translate buttons default to on.
    The JS also accepts both values from the list API response (applyServerSettings).
  endcomment
  assign cx_brand = shop.metafields.cellexia.brand_display_name.value
  assign cx_show_translate = true
  if shop.metafields.cellexia.show_translate.value == false
    assign cx_show_translate = false
  endif

  comment
    v1.1 design version (SPEC-1.1) + v1.3 "luxe" skin (SPEC-1.3): the app
    syncs the merchant-selected skin into the `cellexia.design_theme` shop
    metafield. The case/when guards unknown or missing values back to the
    default "amazon" skin; the JS applies the same setting from the list API
    ride-along (applyServerSettings).
  endcomment
  assign cx_skin = 'amazon'
  case shop.metafields.cellexia.design_theme.value
    when 'cellexia'
      assign cx_skin = 'cellexia'
    when 'luxe'
      assign cx_skin = 'luxe'
  endcase

  assign cx_accent = block.settings.accent_color | append: '' | downcase
  assign cx_style = ''
-%}
{%- if cx_accent != '' and cx_accent != blank and cx_accent != '#ffa41c' -%}
  {%- capture cx_style -%}--cx-star: {{ block.settings.accent_color }}; --cx-star-stroke: {{ block.settings.accent_color | color_darken: 12 }}; --cx-bar: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endif -%}
<div
  id="cellexia-reviews"
  class="cx"
  {% if cx_lang == 'ar' %}dir="rtl"{% endif %}
  {% if cx_style != '' %}style="{{ cx_style }}"{% endif %}
  data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
  data-locale="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}"
  data-shop-default-locale="{{ cx_default_locale }}"
  data-proxy="/apps/cellexia-reviews/api"
  data-per-page="{{ block.settings.per_page | default: 10 }}"
  data-heading="{{ cx_heading | escape }}"
  {% if cx_brand != blank %}data-brand="{{ cx_brand | escape }}"{% endif %}
  data-show-summary="{{ block.settings.show_summary }}"
  data-show-media-strip="{{ block.settings.show_media_strip }}"
  data-show-form="{{ block.settings.show_form }}"
  data-show-translate="{{ cx_show_translate }}"
  data-demo="false"
  data-cx-skin="{{ cx_skin }}"
  data-cx-live="{{ cx_show_full }}"
  {% unless cx_show_full %}hidden{% endunless %}
>
  {%- if cx_show_full -%}
  <div class="cx-layout">
    <div class="cx-layout__rail">
      <section class="cx-header" data-cx="header">
        <h2 class="cx-header__title">{{ cx_heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- if cx_has_stats -%}
        <div class="cx-header__score">
          {% render 'cx-stars', rating: cx_rating, size: 20 %}
          <span class="cx-avg-text">{{ 'cellexia.widget.rating_out_of' | t: rating: cx_rating_str | replace: '[[rating]]', cx_rating_str }}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="cx-header__count">{{ 'cellexia.widget.global_ratings' | t: count: cx_count | replace: '[[count]]', cx_count_str }}</p>
        {%- if cx_dist -%}
        <div class="cx-dist">
          {%- for cx_i in (1..5) reversed -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign cx_i_str = cx_i | append: ''
            assign cx_row = cx_dist[cx_i_str]
            assign cx_pct_val = 0
            if cx_row
              assign cx_pct_val = cx_row.percent | default: 0
            endif
            assign cx_pct_str = cx_pct_val | append: ''
          -%}
          <button
            type="button"
            class="cx-dist__row"
            data-stars="{{ cx_i }}"
            aria-pressed="false"
            aria-label="{{ 'cellexia.a11y.filter_row' | t: stars: cx_i_str | replace: '[[stars]]', cx_i_str | escape }}"
          >
            <span class="cx-dist__label">{{ 'cellexia.widget.star_row' | t: count: cx_i | replace: '[[count]]', cx_i_str }}</span>
            <span class="cx-dist__bar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cx-dist__fill" style="inline-size:{{ cx_pct_val }}%"></span></span>
            <span class="cx-dist__percent" aria-hidden="true">{{ 'cellexia.widget.percent' | t: percent: cx_pct_str | replace: '[[percent]]', cx_pct_str }}</span>
          </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        <details class="cx-how">
          <summary class="cx-how__link">{{ 'cellexia.widget.how_link' | t }}</summary>
          <div class="cx-how__panel" role="note"><p>{{ 'cellexia.widget.how_body' | t }}</p></div>
        </details>
      </section>

      {%- if block.settings.show_summary -%}
      <section class="cx-summary" data-cx="summary"{% unless cx_has_summary %} hidden{% endunless %}>
        {%- if cx_has_summary -%}
        <h3 class="cx-summary__title">{{ 'cellexia.widget.summary_title' | t }}</h3>
        <p class="cx-summary__text">{{ cx_summary.text | escape }}</p>
        <p class="cx-summary__disclaimer">{{ 'cellexia.widget.summary_disclaimer' | t }}</p>
        {%- if cx_topics_size > 0 -%}
        <p class="cx-chips__title" id="cx-chips-title">{{ 'cellexia.widget.chips_title' | t }}</p>
        <ul class="cx-chips" role="list" aria-labelledby="cx-chips-title">
          {%- for cx_topic in cx_summary.topics -%}
          {%- assign cx_topic_neg = false -%}
          {%- if cx_topic.sentiment == 'negative' or cx_topic.sentiment == 'mixed' -%}
            {%- assign cx_topic_neg = true -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          <li class="cx-chips__item">
            <button
              type="button"
              class="cx-chip{% if cx_topic_neg %} cx-chip--neg{% endif %}"
              data-topic="{{ cx_topic.key | escape }}"
              aria-pressed="false"
            >
              <span class="cx-chip__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                {%- if cx_topic_neg -%}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M1.8 6.4c1.3-2 2.9-2 4.2 0s2.9 2 4.2 0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
                {%- else -%}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3.2 8.8 8.8 3.2M4.4 3.2h4.4v4.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
              <span class="cx-chip__label">{{ cx_topic.label | escape }}</span>
              {%- if cx_topic.count -%}<span class="cx-chip__count">({{ cx_topic.count }})</span>{%- endif -%}
            </button>
          </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </section>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if block.settings.show_form -%}
      <div class="cx-write" data-cx="write">
        <button type="button" class="cx-btn cx-btn--write">{{ 'cellexia.widget.write_review' | t }}</button>
      </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="cx-layout__main">
      {%- if block.settings.show_media_strip -%}
      <section class="cx-strip" data-cx="media-strip" hidden>
        <h3 class="cx-strip__title">{{ 'cellexia.widget.media_strip_title' | t }}</h3>
        <div class="cx-strip__list" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'cellexia.widget.gallery_title' | t | escape }}"></div>
      </section>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="cx-controls" data-cx="controls"></div>
      <div class="cx-pills" data-cx="active-filters" hidden></div>

      <div class="cx-list" data-cx="list" aria-live="polite">
        {%- if cx_top_size > 0 -%}
        {%- for cx_r in cx_top limit: 3 -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign cx_r_author = cx_r.author | default: ''
          assign cx_r_initial = cx_r_author | strip | slice: 0 | upcase
          assign cx_r_date_fmt = cx_r.date | date: '%B %d, %Y'
        -%}
        <article class="cx-card" data-cx-ssr>
          <div class="cx-card__head">
            <span class="cx-avatar" aria-hidden="true">{{ cx_r_initial | escape }}</span>
            <span class="cx-card__author">{{ cx_r_author | escape }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cx-card__titleline">
            {% render 'cx-stars', rating: cx_r.rating, size: 16 %}
            {%- if cx_r.title != blank -%}<span class="cx-card__title">{{ cx_r.title | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
          </div>
          {%- if cx_r_date_fmt -%}
          <p class="cx-card__meta">{{ 'cellexia.review.reviewed_on' | t: date: cx_r_date_fmt | replace: '[[date]]', cx_r_date_fmt }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if cx_r.verified -%}
          <p class="cx-badge-verified">{{ 'cellexia.review.verified' | t }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          <div class="cx-card__body"><p>{{ cx_r.body | escape | newline_to_br }}</p></div>
        </article>
        {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
        <p class="cx-empty" data-cx-empty>{{ 'cellexia.widget.no_reviews' | t }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <div class="cx-pagination" data-cx="pagination"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <noscript>
    <style>
      #cellexia-reviews .cx-controls,
      #cellexia-reviews .cx-strip,
      #cellexia-reviews .cx-pagination,
      #cellexia-reviews .cx-write,
      #cellexia-reviews .cx-pills { display: none !important; }
    </style>
    {%- if cx_top_size > 0 -%}
    {%- assign cx_to_str = cx_top_size | append: '' -%}
    <p class="cx-noscript">{{ 'cellexia.widget.showing_count' | t: from: '1', to: cx_to_str, total: cx_count_str | replace: '[[from]]', '1' | replace: '[[to]]', cx_to_str | replace: '[[total]]', cx_count_str }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </noscript>
  {%- else -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Not live, real storefront: minimal hidden shell. The i18n dictionary rides
    inside the root; the JS builds every container itself when previewing.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {% render 'cx-i18n' %}
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% if cx_show_full %}
{% render 'cx-i18n' %}
{% render 'cx-jsonld', product: product %}
{% endif %}
<script src="{{ 'cellexia-reviews.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:cellexia.reviews_block.name",
  "target": "section",
  "templates": ["product"],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:cellexia.reviews_block.settings.heading.label",
      "info": "t:cellexia.reviews_block.settings.heading.info",
      "default": "t:cellexia.defaults.heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_summary",
      "label": "t:cellexia.reviews_block.settings.show_summary.label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_media_strip",
      "label": "t:cellexia.reviews_block.settings.show_media_strip.label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_form",
      "label": "t:cellexia.reviews_block.settings.show_form.label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "per_page",
      "label": "t:cellexia.reviews_block.settings.per_page.label",
      "min": 5,
      "max": 30,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "accent_color",
      "label": "t:cellexia.reviews_block.settings.accent_color.label",
      "info": "t:cellexia.reviews_block.settings.accent_color.info",
      "default": "#FFA41C"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
